  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>T</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Considering that value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;cannot exceed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math>&nbsp;in terms of percentage, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8746;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>T</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>38</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>36</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>min</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>C</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mi>T</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;may assume values&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>63</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>38</mn></math>.</p>",
